---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | KRIYANO"
  description="Read the KRIYANO Terms of Use for website access, AI prompts, tools, content, downloads and third-party services."
>
  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-kicker">Legal</div>

      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>

      <p class="legal-intro">
        These Terms of Use explain the conditions that apply when accessing or
        using KRIYANO, including its tools, prompts, guides, downloads and other
        website content.
      </p>

      <p class="updated">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-section">
    <div class="container legal-layout">
      <article class="legal-content">
        <section>
          <h2>1. Acceptance of these terms</h2>

          <p>
            By accessing or using KRIYANO, you agree to use the website in
            accordance with these Terms of Use.
          </p>

          <p>
            If you do not agree with these terms, you should discontinue use of
            the website.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>2. Purpose of KRIYANO</h2>

          <p>
            KRIYANO provides practical AI tools, prompts, workflows, guides and
            educational resources intended to help users apply artificial
            intelligence to real-world tasks.
          </p>

          <p>
            Content is provided for general informational, educational and
            productivity purposes.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>3. AI-generated outputs</h2>

          <p>
            KRIYANO may help users create prompts or structured instructions for
            use with third-party artificial intelligence platforms.
          </p>

          <p>
            Artificial intelligence systems can produce inaccurate, incomplete
            or inappropriate results. Users are responsible for reviewing,
            verifying and deciding how any AI-generated output is used.
          </p>

          <p>
            KRIYANO does not guarantee the accuracy, completeness, suitability or
            reliability of results produced by external AI systems.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>4. Professional decisions</h2>

          <p>
            Information, prompts and tools provided by KRIYANO should not be
            treated as professional legal, medical, financial, tax, regulatory
            or other specialist advice.
          </p>

          <p>
            Users should obtain appropriate professional advice when a decision
            requires specialist knowledge or may create significant legal,
            financial, health, safety or regulatory consequences.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>5. User responsibilities</h2>

          <p>
            Users are responsible for the information they enter into KRIYANO
            tools and for how they use prompts, outputs, templates, downloads or
            other materials obtained through the website.
          </p>

          <p>
            Users should avoid entering confidential, sensitive, proprietary or
            personally identifiable information unless they understand how that
            information may be processed by the services they choose to use.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>6. Acceptable use</h2>

          <p>
            You may not use KRIYANO in a way that intentionally disrupts the
            website, attempts to gain unauthorised access to its systems, abuses
            website resources or violates applicable law.
          </p>

          <p>
            Automated scraping, copying or extraction that places an unreasonable
            load on the website or attempts to reproduce substantial portions of
            KRIYANO without permission may be restricted.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>7. Intellectual property</h2>

          <p>
            Unless otherwise stated, the KRIYANO website design, original written
            content, branding, prompt structures, tools, guides and downloadable
            materials are owned by or provided through KRIYANO.
          </p>

          <p>
            Users may use publicly available prompts and tools for their own
            personal or business tasks, subject to any additional terms shown
            with a specific resource.
          </p>

          <p>
            Republishing, reselling or presenting substantial KRIYANO content as
            your own original work may require permission.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>8. Third-party platforms and links</h2>

          <p>
            KRIYANO may reference or link to third-party AI platforms, websites,
            products, software or services.
          </p>

          <p>
            KRIYANO does not control those services and is not responsible for
            their availability, policies, security, pricing, outputs or content.
          </p>

          <p>
            Use of third-party services is subject to the terms and policies of
            those providers.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>9. Downloads and digital resources</h2>

          <p>
            KRIYANO may provide downloadable templates, guides, prompt packs or
            other digital materials.
          </p>

          <p>
            Additional licence, payment or usage conditions may apply to certain
            free or paid resources and will be stated where relevant.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>10. Advertising and affiliate links</h2>

          <p>
            KRIYANO may display advertisements or use affiliate links in the
            future.
          </p>

          <p>
            Where appropriate, commercial relationships or affiliate links may be
            disclosed in accordance with applicable requirements.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>11. Availability of the website</h2>

          <p>
            KRIYANO aims to keep the website available and functioning properly,
            but uninterrupted access cannot be guaranteed.
          </p>

          <p>
            Features, pages, tools or services may be modified, suspended or
            removed when necessary for maintenance, improvement or other
            operational reasons.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>12. Limitation of liability</h2>

          <p>
            To the extent permitted by applicable law, KRIYANO is not responsible
            for losses or damages resulting from reliance on website content,
            AI-generated outputs, third-party services or decisions made using
            information obtained through the website.
          </p>

          <p>
            Users remain responsible for evaluating whether a tool, prompt,
            workflow or output is appropriate for their particular situation.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>13. Changes to these terms</h2>

          <p>
            These Terms of Use may be updated as KRIYANO introduces new tools,
            downloads, paid products, advertising, accounts or other features.
          </p>

          <p>
            The latest version will be published on this page with an updated
            revision date.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>14. Contact</h2>

          <p>
            Questions about these Terms of Use can be submitted through the
            contact information provided on the KRIYANO website.
          </p>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    padding: 100px 0 70px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 80% 20%,
        rgba(183, 255, 74, 0.08),
        transparent 30%
      ),
      var(--bg);
  }

  .legal-hero h1 {
    margin-top: 16px;
    max-width: 850px;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.8rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
  }

  .legal-intro {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-top: 26px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .updated {
    margin-top: 20px;
    color: var(--lime);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .legal-section {
    padding: 85px 0 110px;
  }

  .legal-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 820px);
  }

  .legal-content {
    display: grid;
    gap: 48px;
  }

  .legal-content section {
    padding-bottom: 40px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .legal-content section:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    margin-top: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .legal-content p:first-of-type {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .legal-hero {
      padding: 64px 0 48px;
    }

    .legal-hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 13vw, 4rem);
    }

    .legal-intro {
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .legal-section {
      padding: 58px 0 75px;
    }

    .legal-content {
      gap: 34px;
    }

    .legal-content section {
      padding-bottom: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>